# Commit graph.json (date-stable graph data) and GRAPH_REPORT.md (human-readable map) so
# reviewers and agents inherit an accurate map. Ignore everything that drifts or is local:
#   - graph.html: large interactive viewer, regenerated by `graphify update` (diff noise) —
#     rebuild on demand with `graphify export html`.
#   - cache/, cost.json, manifest.json: machine-specific build state (absolute paths/mtimes).
cache/
cost.json
manifest.json
graph.html
.graphify_*
.needs_update

# Dated snapshot dirs that `graphify update` writes (e.g. 2026-06-11/) — local history only.
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
